  "title": "Steamed Vegan Rice Cakes (Banh Bo Hap)",
  "description": "Steam a batch of these vegan rice cakes made with gluten-free rice flour, tapioca starch, coconut milk, and optional food coloring for a kid-friendly dessert.",
